  "question": {
    "html": "<p>A block of mass 2.0 kg is placed on a trolley of mass 5.0 kg, moving horizontally. A force of 8.0 N is applied to the block which slides on the surface of the trolley. The frictional force between the trolley and the ground is zero.</p>\n<p><figure data-asset-id=\"fig_01\"><img alt=\"Source question diagram 1\" src=\"asset:fig_01\"/></figure></p>\n<p>The trolley accelerates at a rate of 1.0 m s<sup>−2</sup>. What is the coefficient of dynamic friction between the block and the trolley?</p>\n<p>[1]</p>\n<ol class=\"mcq-options\"><li data-label=\"A\">0.05</li><li data-label=\"B\">0.15</li><li data-label=\"C\">0.25</li><li data-label=\"D\">0.35</li></ol>"
  },
